26:["$","section","Know what remains unanswered",{"id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Know what remains unanswered"}],[["$","p","If you can view a result but have not received an explanation, contact the ordering office about its review process. Ask how long to wait and whom to contact if you do not hear back. No message is not a reliable substitute for a confirmed plan.",{"children":"If you can view a result but have not received an explanation, contact the ordering office about its review process. Ask how long to wait and whom to contact if you do not hear back. No message is not a reliable substitute for a confirmed plan."}],["$","p","Established patients can check lab orders and results through Healow using practice code FGCJBD. If an order is missing before a planned lab visit, ask the office first. For a time-sensitive concern, call; for a medical emergency, call 911 rather than waiting for portal communication.",{"children":"Established patients can check lab orders and results through Healow using practice code FGCJBD. If an order is missing before a planned lab visit, ask the office first. For a time-sensitive concern, call; for a medical emergency, call 911 rather than waiting for portal communication."}]],false]}]
